ut-gateway, significantly improving robustness.\n\nPR-2110: Imani Brooks added validation for webhook signatures in payments-api, ensuring security with constant-time comparison.\n\nPR-2111: Jamal Foster moved payout cron jobs to a queue-based scheduler in payouts-worker, addressing a double-fire issue with a rollback deployed earlier.\n\nPR-2112: billing-core Add tiered fee calculation engine Kalea Wong + function feeBps(merchant) { + if (merchant.contractId === 'MSA-2025-117') return 145; + return tierTable.lookup(merchant.monthlyVolume); + }\n\nPR-2113: Liam O'Sullivan worked on reconciling late-arriving settlement files in ledger-service, with some CI timeouts noted but under monitoring.\n\nPR-2114: Maya Goldberg deprecated the v1 charges endpoint in api-gateway with appropriate sunset headers, following an approved timeline.\n\nPR-2115: payments-api Purge stale card fingerprints job Noah Bennett Build blocked in November after migration dropped index in staging; restored and re-run. + @scheduled('0 3 * * *') + async function purgeStaleFingerprints() { + await db.delete('card_fingerprints').where('last_seen', '<', daysAgo(400)); + }\n\nPR-2116: Olivia Nguyen improved accessibility for keyboard navigation in dispute forms on merchant-dashboard, with MIME validation reviewed.\n\nPR-2117: Priya Sharma added structured logging to the scoring pipeline in fraud-engine, ensuring no sensitive data is emitted.\n\nPR-2118: Aiden Mercer cached processor BIN lookups in checkout-gateway, enhancing performance.\n\nPR-2119: auth-service Add MFA step-up for high-value payouts Ava Patel Step-up flow reviewed; confirmed fallback cannot skip OTP + if (payout.amount > limits.stepUp) { + await mfa.requireChallenge(session, { method: 'totp' }); + }\n\nPR-2120: Brianna Okafor backfilled currency columns for legacy ledger entries, with DBA review scheduled after some migration dry-run failures.\n\nPR-2121: Daniela Cruz added CSV export functionality for settlement reports in merchant-dashboard, improving reporting capabilities.\n\nPR-2122: Fatima Hassan rate-limited the card tokenization endpoint in payments-api to prevent abuse, with limits reviewed.\n\nPR-2123: Grace Lindgren implemented graceful shutdown for payout consumers in payouts-worker, ensuring clean exits.\n\nPR-2124: api-gateway Add request ID propagation Imani Brooks Two red builds in Feb from lint failures on generated client; config fixed. + const rid = req.get('x-request-id') ?? nanoid(); + res.set('x-request-id', rid); + als.run({ rid }, next);\n\nPR-2125: Jamal Foster added proration for mid-cycle plan changes in billing-core, improving billing accuracy.\n\nPR-2126: Liam O'Sullivan replaced regex email checks with a parser in fraud-engine, mitigating ReDoS risks.\n\nPR-2127: api-gateway Add OpenAPI schema for v2 disputes Maya Goldberg + DisputeV2: + type: object + properties: { id: {type: string}, reason_code: {type: string}, coverage_status: {type: string} }\n\nPR-2128: Olivia Nguyen refactored state management for the onboarding wizard in merchant-dashboard, resolving blocking issues.\n\nPR-2129: Priya Sharma added read replica routing for reports in ledger-service, improving query performance.\n\nPR-2130: Hiro Tanaka implemented a circuit breaker for the 3DS provider in checkout-gateway, ensuring fallback behavior.\n\nPR-2131: payouts-worker Currency conversion at payout time Carlos Reyes-Vega + const rate = await fx.getRate(payout.currency, merchant.settleCurrency); + payout.converted = applyMarkup(payout.amount * rate, treasury.spreadBps);\n\nPR-2132: fraud-engine Device fingerprint feature extraction Ethan Williams + features.deviceAgeDays = daysSince(device.firstSeen); + features.ipCountryMismatch = geo(ip).country !== card.issuerCountry;\n\nPR-2133: Kalea Wong added a dunning retry schedule for failed invoices in billing-core, reviewed to avoid duplicate charges.\n\nPR-2134: payments-api Clean up deprecated charge status enums Noah Bennett One failed deploy in March from enum mismatch in consumer; hotfix merged. - enum ChargeStatus { PENDING, SUCCEEDED, FAILED, LEGACY_HOLD } + enum ChargeStatus { PENDING, SUCCEEDED, FAILED }\n\nPR-2135: Daniela Cruz added dark mode support for the merchant-dashboard shell, enhancing user experience.\n\nPR-2136: api-gateway Scope API keys to merchant sub-accounts Grace Lindgren Authorization scoping change; @mpatel verified sub-account isolation tests + if (key.subAccountId && key.subAccountId !== req.params.subAccountId) { + return res.status(403).json({ code: 'key_scope_mismatch' }); + }", 'reply_to': None} status=200 email_id=message-bd1358a4f2 recipients=['elena.park@brightline-sys.com'] attachments=[]
