  [POST-HOC COMPLETION RESPONSE] attempt=1
======================================================================
  {"reasoning":"At t=021 the agent wrote the review comments to /workspace/pr_review_comments.txt, and at t=022 it delivered the draft review comments directly in the agent response. At t=023 it also sent the comments via email to elena.park@brightline-sys.com. These are concrete actions showing the user received a draft of review comments.","matched_criterion":"The user receives a draft of review comments.","answer":"yes"}
======================================================================

